   owl:annotatedTarget "Accident in which a breach in a reactor’s pressure boundary causes the coolant water to rush out of the reactor faster than makeup water can be added back in"@en ;
   :referenceNRC "https://www.nrc.gov/reading-rm/basic-ref/glossary/loss-of-coolant-accident-loca.htm"^^xsd:anyURI
 ] .


