   rdfs:isDefinedBy "https://www.collinsdictionary.com/dictionary/english/explosion#:~:text=explosion%20in%20Chemical%20Engineering&text=An%20explosion%20is%20a%20sudden%20catastrophic%20release%20of%20energy%2C%20causing,container%20of%20pressurized%20gas%20ruptures."
 ] .


