                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Loss of the ability of a system to function within acceptance criteria. The system is considered to fail when it becomes incapable of functioning, whether or not this is needed at that time."@en ;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "SystemFailure"@en .

[ rdf:type owl:Axiom ;
