   :referenceNSSG "https://vocabulary.iaea.org/iaea-safety-glossary/949.html"^^xsd:anyURI
 ] .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/neo#NPPDecommissioning
:NPPDecommissioning rdf:type owl:Class ;
                         rdfs:subClassOf :Operation ;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "NuclearReactorDecommissioning"@en ;
                         <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "take an engineered system or component out of service, render it inoperative, dismantle and decontaminate it"@en ;
