   owl:annotatedTarget """container designed primarily for the storage of pressurized fluid, which fulfils at least one of the following criteria:

    a) contains gas or liquid with high energy level;
    b) contains gas or liquid which will create a mishap (accident) if released;
    c) contains gas or liquid with high pressure level﻿"""@en ;
   :referenceISO "﻿ISO 21347:2005(en)  Space systems — Fracture and damage control﻿"^^xsd:anyURI
 ] .


