   :referenceISO <https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso:12749:-5:ed-1:v1:en:term:3.1.1.2>
 ] .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/neo#ControlRod
:ControlRod rdf:type owl:Class ;
