   :referenceARIS <https://aris.iaea.org/Glossary/>
 ] .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/neo#NPPUnintendedEvent
:NPPUnintendedEvent rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf :UnintendedEvent ,
                                        [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                          owl:onProperty elite:foregoes ;
                                          owl:someValuesFrom :HazardousNuclearEvent
                                        ] ;
                        rdfs:comment """An unintended event is any occurrence unintended
by the operator, including operating error, equipment failure or other mishap, and deliberate
action on the part of others, the consequences or potential consequences of which are not
negligible from the point of view of protection and safety"""@en ;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#comment> "Missed DefinedBy" ;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """Is any occurrence that can lead to potential consequences that are not
negligible from the point of view of protection and safety of a Nuclear power plant"""@en ;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "NPPUnintendedEvent"@en ;
                        :referenceNSSG <https://vocabulary.iaea.org/iaea-safety-glossary/923.html> .


