###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/neo#DefenceinDepthProcedures
:DefenceinDepthProcedures rdf:type owl:Class ;
                        rdfs:subClassOf :Operation ,
                                        [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                          owl:onProperty elite:isSubProcessOf ;
                                          owl:someValuesFrom :NPPOperationManagement
                                        ] ;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """A hierarchical deployment of different levels of diverse equipment and procedures to prevent the escalation
