a radiation source or radioactive material and workers, members of the public or the environment, in
operational states and, for some barriers, in accident conditions"""@en ;
   :referenceNSSG "https://vocabulary.iaea.org/iaea-safety-glossary/1069.html"^^xsd:anyURI
 ] .


